Z||000001||kempo||09-03-2001||10:18 PM||||Around here, we have a Costco, if you don't know, it's a similiar store to Sam's Club...  They have 360 minute MCI phone cards for $20.  I use them a lot, and they work great.  Want me to pick a few of them up for you?  <BR>Sorry, I have no idea about international phone calls.<P>-Kemp||||reg||1
