Z||000007||Hank is Here||09-04-2001||04:37 PM||||Ski,<BR> the best here is Sams club 500 min domestic and 90 min international for $20.  However when I was in Belgium this past summer the cards were cheaper to buy there to call the USA.  I would send her over with one card from here, have her check out the prices there-if it is worse  you can get another card and just email her the code.  Make sure she calls to get the international number before she leaves the USA||||reg||1
